<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_PA-147.1-customer-safety-risk-strategy-standards-and-premises-liability-framework" targetNamespace="https://erpplans.local/bpmn" exporter="erpplans generate-bpmn.py" exporterVersion="1.0">
    <bpmn:process id="W_W4385" name="W4385. Customer Safety &amp; Premises-Liability Strategy, Scope &amp; Operating Model" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Enterprise risk review; major incident; new format/zone
Frequency: Annual + on strategic change
Volume: One enterprise customer-safety &amp; premises-liability program across ~205 public sites
Owner: Head of Customer Safety / Risk (VS-21) / COO
Participants: Risk (VS-21), Store Ops (VS-07), HSE (VS-24), Legal (VS-100), Insurance/BCP (VS-26), IFM (VS-138), Real Estate (VS-97)
Source: workflow W4385 — Customer Safety &amp; Premises-Liability Strategy, Scope &amp; Operating Model</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4385_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4385_Lane1" name="Head of Customer Safety">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4385_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4385_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4385_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4385_Lane2" name="Risk">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4385_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4385_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4385_Start4" name="Enterprise risk review; major incident; new format/zone">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4385_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4385_Task5" name="Risk/Customer Safety set the program strategy — scope (in-store, yard, parking…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Risk/Customer Safety set the program strategy — scope (in-store, yard, parking, will-call, doorstep), objectives (zero fatalities, injury-rate target, claim-cost cap), and the prevention-by-design operating model
Responsible (R): Head of Customer Safety / Risk
Accountable (A): COO / Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4385_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4385_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4385_Task6" name="Risk map the exposure landscape — premises-liability bodily injury, property…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Risk map the exposure landscape — premises-liability bodily injury, property damage, falling/shifted stock, powered-equipment contact, chemical exposure, crowd crush, parking — and the loss-history baseline
Responsible (R): Risk / Insurance / Legal
Accountable (A): Head of Customer Safety / Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4385_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4385_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4385_Task7" name="Risk document &amp; approve the strategy, then cascade to standards (W4386)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Risk document &amp; approve the strategy, then cascade to standards (W4386), liability/insurance framework (W4387), governance (W4388), zone design (W4389), and the incident system (W4392)
Responsible (R): Head of Customer Safety / Risk
Accountable (A): COO / Audit Committee
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4385_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4385_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4385_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4385_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4385_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-671 (ensure controlled execution — Customer Safety Risk Strategy, Standards &amp; Premises-Liability Framework (PA-147.1).) | - CTL-671: strategy approved by COO/Audit Committee; scope covers all customer zones; loss-history baseline established; reviewed annually (W4407)
Owner: Head of Customer Safety / Risk (VS-21) / COO</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4385_Assoc10" sourceRef="W4385_Annotation9" targetRef="W4385_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4385_Flow11" sourceRef="W4385_Start4" targetRef="W4385_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4385_Flow12" sourceRef="W4385_Task5" targetRef="W4385_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4385_Flow13" sourceRef="W4385_Task6" targetRef="W4385_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4385_Flow14" sourceRef="W4385_Task7" targetRef="W4385_End8" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W4385_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W4385_plane" bpmnElement="W_W4385">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4385_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W4385_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
