    <bpmn:process id="W_W4387" name="W4387. Premises-Liability, Insurance &amp; Legal Framework" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Strategy (W4385); insurance renewal; claim; legal review
Frequency: Annual + on renewal/claim
Volume: One premises-liability/insurance framework; ~205 covered locations
Owner: Insurance/Risk Transfer (VS-26) / Legal (VS-100) / Customer Safety
Participants: Insurance/BCP (VS-26), Legal (VS-100), Treasury (VS-18), Risk (VS-21), Customer Safety
Source: workflow W4387 — Premises-Liability, Insurance &amp; Legal Framework</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4387_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4387_Lane1" name="Insurance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4387_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4387_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4387_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4387_Lane2" name="Legal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4387_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4387_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4387_Start4" name="Strategy (W4385); insurance renewal; claim; legal review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4387_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4387_Task5" name="Insurance/Legal define the premises-liability coverage framework — CGL/public…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Insurance/Legal define the premises-liability coverage framework — CGL/public liability limits, deductibles, TPA arrangement, named-peril vs all-risk, and the additional-insured requirement for landlord/lessor sites
Responsible (R): Insurance / Legal / Treasury
Accountable (A): CFO / Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk / VP Legal
Duration: Annual + renewal</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4387_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4387_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4387_Task6" name="Customer Safety/Insurance set the claims-handling protocol (notice, TPA…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Customer Safety/Insurance set the claims-handling protocol (notice, TPA liaison, reserve, settlement authority) and the loss-data feedback loop into prevention (W4385/W4386)
Responsible (R): Insurance / Customer Safety / Legal
Accountable (A): CFO / Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4387_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4387_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4387_Task7" name="Legal set the litigation/defense framework (counsel panel, defense strategy…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Legal set the litigation/defense framework (counsel panel, defense strategy, settlement authority, NLRC/court process) and the statutory-notification matrix (W4405)
Responsible (R): Legal / Insurance
Accountable (A): VP Legal / CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4387_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4387_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4387_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4387_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4387_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-671 (ensure controlled execution — Customer Safety Risk Strategy, Standards &amp; Premises-Liability Framework (PA-147.1).) | - CTL-671: limits exposure-based &amp; renewed; TPA-governed; 24-hr notification (W4405); loss-data fed to prevention
Owner: Insurance/Risk Transfer (VS-26) / Legal (VS-100) / Customer Safety</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4387_Assoc10" sourceRef="W4387_Annotation9" targetRef="W4387_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
