    <bpmn:process id="W_W4388" name="W4388. Customer Safety Governance, Roles &amp; Accountability (RACI)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Program setup; governance review
Frequency: Annual + on restructure
Volume: One governance/RACI framework
Owner: Customer Safety / Risk (VS-21) / Governance (VS-36)
Participants: Risk (VS-21), Governance (VS-36), Store Ops (VS-07), HSE (VS-24), Legal (VS-100), Audit (VS-21)
Source: workflow W4388 — Customer Safety Governance, Roles &amp; Accountability (RACI)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4388_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4388_Lane1" name="Customer Safety">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4388_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4388_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4388_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4388_Lane2" name="Audit">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4388_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4388_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4388_Start4" name="Program setup; governance review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4388_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4388_Task5" name="Customer Safety/Risk establish the governance structure — program owner, site…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Customer Safety/Risk establish the governance structure — program owner, site accountability (Store Manager as first-line), second-line HSE/Risk assurance, third-line Audit, and Board/Audit-Committee oversight
Responsible (R): Customer Safety / Risk / Governance
Accountable (A): COO / Audit Committee
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
