      <bpmn:userTask id="W4388_Task6" name="Customer Safety publish the RACI — who inspects (store/HSE), who approves…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Customer Safety publish the RACI — who inspects (store/HSE), who approves corrective action, who manages claims, who notifies regulators/insurers — across all sites and zones
Responsible (R): Customer Safety / Risk
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
