      <bpmn:userTask id="W4389_Task6" name="Customer Safety/Real Estate design zone-specific safety: sales-floor (aisle…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Customer Safety/Real Estate design zone-specific safety: sales-floor (aisle width, clear-height, endcap stability, spill protocol); lumber/tile yard (separated pedestrian/forklift lanes, stacked-load height limits, banding); parking (lighting, crosswalks, cart corrals, speed)
Responsible (R): Customer Safety / Real Estate / HSE
Accountable (A): Head of Customer Safety / COO
Duration: Per design</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4389_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4389_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4389_Task7" name="Merchandising/IFM specify safe stacking/pallet/racking &amp; display standards…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Merchandising/IFM specify safe stacking/pallet/racking &amp; display standards (load, height, stability, restraint) per merchandise type (cement, tile, lumber, appliances) and embed in planogram (VS-55)
Responsible (R): Merchandising / IFM / Customer Safety
Accountable (A): Head of Customer Safety / VP Merchandising
Duration: Per change</bpmn:documentation>
