        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Store Ops/IFM implement the design (barriers, signage, line-marking, lighting), inspect on change, and feed learning into W4386/W4402
Responsible (R): Store Ops / IFM
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
