        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Vendor Mgmt/Legal set third-party on-premises safety terms — contractor safety induction, insurance/indemnity (additional-insured), equipment rules during trading hours, incident-reporting duty — in contracts
Responsible (R): Vendor Mgmt / Legal / Customer Safety
Accountable (A): VP Legal / Head of Customer Safety
