Responsible (R): Customer Safety / HSE / Store Ops
Accountable (A): Head of Customer Safety / VP Legal
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4390_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4390_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
