      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Program operation; regulatory change; inspection
Frequency: Annual + continuous adherence
Volume: Program-wide multi-regulator compliance
Owner: Compliance (VS-22) / Customer Safety / Legal (VS-100)
Participants: Compliance (VS-22), Legal (VS-100), HSE (VS-24), Customer Safety, LGU (VS-76), Fire/Safety Officer (VS-138)
Source: workflow W4391 — Customer Safety Compliance — Consumer Act, BFP Fire Code, OSH &amp; Local Codes</bpmn:documentation>
