      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4391_Task5" name="Compliance/Legal map the customer-safety regulatory landscape — Consumer Act…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Compliance/Legal map the customer-safety regulatory landscape — Consumer Act (RA 7394) premises/labeling, BFP Fire Code (RA 9514) egress/fire-load/assembly-occupancy, OSH customer-facing duties, LGU/local ordinances, and building-code accessibility (BP 344)
Responsible (R): Compliance / Legal / Customer Safety
Accountable (A): VP Legal / Head of Customer Safety
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4391_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4391_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4391_Task6" name="Customer Safety/HSE translate regulations into the standards (W4386) and zone…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Customer Safety/HSE translate regulations into the standards (W4386) and zone design (W4389), and maintain the compliance calendar
Responsible (R): Customer Safety / HSE / Compliance
Accountable (A): Head of Customer Safety
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4391_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4391_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4391_Task7" name="Compliance/Legal manage inspections/audits by BFP/LGU/DTI/DOLE, respond to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Compliance/Legal manage inspections/audits by BFP/LGU/DTI/DOLE, respond to findings, and report to governance (W4388/W4407)
Responsible (R): Compliance / Legal / Customer Safety
Accountable (A): VP Legal / Audit Committee
Duration: Per inspection</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4391_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
