Frequency: Per lifecycle + continuous operation
Volume: One customer-safety data/incident architecture
Owner: Customer Safety / IT (VS-27) / EA (VS-113) / BI (VS-28)
Participants: IT (VS-27), EA (VS-113), BI (VS-28), Risk (VS-21), Privacy (VS-91), Legal (VS-100), HSE (VS-24)
Source: workflow W4392 — Customer Safety Data, Incident System &amp; Measurement Architecture</bpmn:documentation>
