      <bpmn:userTask id="W4392_Task5" name="Customer Safety/EA/IT design the incident-management &amp; safety-data architecture…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Customer Safety/EA/IT design the incident-management &amp; safety-data architecture — near-miss/incident capture (mobile), hazard register, inspection, corrective action, claims link (VS-26), and CCTV/video-evidence integration
Responsible (R): Customer Safety / EA / IT / BI
Accountable (A): CIO / Head of Customer Safety
Duration: Per lifecycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4392_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4392_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4392_Task6" name="IT/Privacy implement with PII minimization (injured-customer data), secure…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: IT/Privacy implement with PII minimization (injured-customer data), secure evidence store, retention (VS-88), and integration to Risk (VS-21), Legal (VS-100), Insurance (VS-26), BI (VS-28)
Responsible (R): IT / Privacy / Legal
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: Per deployment</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4392_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4392_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4392_Task7" name="Customer Safety/BI govern the platform, drive analytics (W4408), and optimize…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Customer Safety/BI govern the platform, drive analytics (W4408), and optimize on adoption/cost (VS-135)
Responsible (R): Customer Safety / BI / IT
Accountable (A): COO / CIO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4392_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4392_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4392_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4392_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
