        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-671 (ensure controlled execution — Customer Safety Risk Strategy, Standards &amp; Premises-Liability Framework (PA-147.1).) | - CTL-671: architecture security-assessed (VS-27.3); PII minimized/secured (VS-91); CCTV-evidence retained per policy (VS-88); cost governed (VS-135)
Owner: Customer Safety / IT (VS-27) / EA (VS-113) / BI (VS-28)</bpmn:text>
